<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the “Solidarity” room.\rIt show the bond between homies\nand people, plus the history\fof the Pokéathlon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Only Pokéathletes who came\nin first in five courses\fcan come in here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the “Trust” room.\nGo on ahead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokéathlon go WAY back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you win a course,\nyou get a Medal!\fI gotta win every course!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard Pokéathletes with crazy\nrecords get their shoes\fdisplayed in the museum!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} checked\nthe course record!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a old wall paintin’.\rOne person and three homies\nlook like they learnin’ somethin’\ffrom starin’ at the sky.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a old, beat-up scroll.\r“Pokéathlon Myth\rWhen a sickness took over the whole\nisland, one human and three homies\fbeat ten obstacles to spread the\fword about the cure.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a old scroll.\r“The Beginnin’ of Pokéathlon\rTo honor the bond of the\nperson and three homies that\fspread the word of the cure, people\fstarted tellin’ their story.”\r...\nThe tribute eventually turned into\ften games to compete in, just\flike the obstacles in the legend...”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RATTATA: Ffft!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RATTATA: Kooar!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ZUBAT: Quuooh.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0140_D49R0104_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Pokéathlon Almanac”\rThere’s mad Pokéathletes and\nhomie Medalists in\fthe pics.\n</language>
	</row>
</body>
